<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:47:53 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Kô-rinh-tô thưq vaarq</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kô-rinh-tô</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Co</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kô-rinh-tô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Phao-lô, adro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu bơyh iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, ji adro oh ay Ti-mô-thê, atăq ka tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk măn aduq Kô-rinh-tô, kung ka dêq hloay khơl vah đong măn đom loch dêh A-chai. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, ji Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, truh tol oh ay!<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Đangq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk ji Vaq ku Lôôk haay — Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu — 'ngưq laa Vaq ku varơuq angơuq, ji Kơy Plêêk ku tôôy varơuq hlơq hlôôp, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />laa Kơy hlơq hlôôp 'wot đom tôôy pơơl dal ku 'wot, jarooy truh varơuq khienq ka 'wot hnoq ik hlơq hlôôp khơl adro măn đom tôôy pơơl dal bơơn varơuq hlơq hlôôp đơu kadih 'wot jah hlơq hlôôp bơyh Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Vii đaji kaluh pơơl jiq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hoot galaay tol 'wot đaleq, yôôych varơuq hlơq hlôôp ku 'wot gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung hoot galaay đanưq. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Bơh atoh 'wot chiuq pơơl dal, yôôych nưq laa vii varơuq hlơq hlôôp ji varơuq wơơt xok ku oh ay; atoh 'wot jah hlơq hlôôp, yôôych nưq laa vii varơuq hlơq hlôôp ku oh ay, laa varơuq jah hmưq tavơh đom varơuq chiuq uunq kung kaluh pơơl jiq đơu kadih 'wot kung đong chiuq. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ji xuum takôô gamưh ku 'wot truh oh ay laa kajưk dik, tuôôy xet đaneq đaji oh ay laa khơl manih kung jưq phon đom varơuq pơơl jiq đaleq, yôôych kung jưq phon đom varơuq hlơq hlôôp đanưq. <verse eid="2CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Wơơy oh ay, vii 'wot leh xung oh ay be xet truh kaluh pơơl hwơơl heq xalih truh ka 'wot aduq A-si, đaneq 'wot heq chiuq raanq gengq qwaq mưk, galơh taalh paraat, truh nôôy 'wot pheq đnooy dêq hloay leh e takôô gamưh xôq riirh. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Lunư, kadih 'wot 'miêh heq e xadrah păk kaxêêt pi'lăp 'wot, xôq ka 'wot be hnoq ik gamưh aduq kadih xăk, bơh laa aduq Kơy Plêêk, Kơy khienq adro kaxêêt riirh hlê, <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />laa Kơy heq wơơt xok 'wot klơlh varơuq kaxêêt kôt đa hơq, yôôych Kadraq hnoq wơơt xok 'wot — 'ngưq laa măn aduq Kadraq, 'wot e xuum takôô gamưh đaneq Kadraq kung hnoq măn wơơt xok 'wot đnoyq, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />tuôôy oh ay kung jưq phon waak đom varơuq apôôy vii kơq 'wot — xôq ka vlôh xing 'ngưng adro, vanong kaxay truh tol 'wot, Kơy Plêêk nhonq xok kaluh apok kuh kway bơyh 'ngưng adro vii kơq 'wot.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Vii varơuq hlah xuum ku 'wot laa đaneq: apok xanưk ku xuum klaak 'wot, đaneq 'wot heq xa măn katul dêh araak đom varơuq hlăng vah ji dong dik ku Kơy Plêêk, leh aalq xing varơuq khôôt xet tyauq xăk xamơk, bơh bơyh vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, đơu nhưk laa đôôyq dii oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Vii 'wot be valơk ka oh ay varơuq kajoq đêh, pi gôk kaluh varơuq đơu oh ay đok ik ji hlolh ik, bơh gô takôô gamưh đaneq oh ay hnoq hlolh dong dêq — <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kung đaji oh ay heq hlolh 'wot phon leq — đaneq 'wot laa varơuq hlah xuum ku oh ay, yôôych oh ay kung đanưq đôôyq dii 'wot, đom hngơy ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ji dii varơuq tuôq gamưh nưq, adroyq neq gô đinq truh dii oh ay, xôq oh ay hnoq ik e vanong kaxay yưk thưq vaarq, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />yôôch xing aduq oh ay xôq hooy hlê truh Ma-xê-đoan, ji xing Ma-xê-đoan laay truh dii oh ay, yôôch jah oh ay jarooy dưk hooy truh Ju-đê. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Vii anưq, tuôôy đong đinq varơuq neq, yôôych e aalq be laa gô heq dưk dơơp đom varơuq tyauq xăk xamơk? Long gô heq đinq varơuq gô đong đinq tyauq xăk xamơk, xôq yôôch đom gô laa “Jơq, jơq” hloay “Lưp, lưp” ih? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk laa jư apok, lunưq apok ku 'wot deng ka oh ay yôôych leh aalq vơơ “Jơq” vơơ “Lưp” 'leq. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Vii Koot Kơy Plêêk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Kơy heq jah padoh taboon đom katul oh ay bơyh 'wot — 'ngưq laa bơyh gô ji Sin-vanh kung Ti-mô-thê — be aalq laa vơơ “Jơq” vơơ “Lưp,” đơu đom Kadraq 'miêh hloay laa “Jơq”. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Bơyh xet taleq apok tavek ku Kơy Plêêk raay laa “Jơq” đom Kadraq. Jo nưq, kung gamưh Kadraq, apok “Amen” gamưh haay tưp tok Kơy Plêêk vii tađnah tađnaak Kadraq. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Panưh kadrơy, Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy lôp kajưk 'wot dii oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji heq para jơu ka 'wot, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />kung laa Kơy heq đongq dơuq 'wot ji kahniq varơuq dưk xanưk ku Kơy Phool Hiel muut đom xuum 'wot.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Măn gô yôôych apôôy vôôch Kơy Plêêk dơơp manih xanưk ka phool hiel gô đaneq vii heq nhiinq ka'lăk ka oh ay, gô heq leh hooy truh Kô-rinh-tô đnoyq. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Be aalq bơyh 'wot e qwuyen da uh tol xuum tuôq oh ay, bơh bơyh 'wot laa khơl 'wơyq kung dơơp varơuq vii varơuq hlah ku oh ay, jo oh ay heq dưk kajưk đom xuum tuôq yôôch.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Vii gô heq 'yo hloq varơuq neq laa tolh ka kadih xăk xôq leh truh dii oh ay yưk tra đom varơuq hlu rơu. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Bơyh atoh kadih xăk gô dơơp oh ay hlu rơu, yôôych akơyq laa adro dơơp ka gô hlah hlaak, atoh leh aalq adro biq gô dơơp ka hlu rơu? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ji gô heq valơk kung muuyq varơuq đaneq, xôq atêq tuôôy truh, gô klơlh tavơh varơuq hlu rơu xing khơl adro đơu đangq vlôh gô pheq hlah hlaak, vii heq xôq xuum tuôq aduq dêq hloay oh ay đaneq xuum hlah ku gô laa xuum hlah ku dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Vii vlôh xing đơơt pơơl hwơơl kôt lơyq ji xuum klaak kagul kaxul, gô heq valơk ka oh ay bơơn 'ngưng daak mot, leh aalq xôq oh ay biq hlu rơu, bơh laa xôq oh ay hnoq ik nhonq vlôh xuum xung xiaq đơu gô e deng ka oh ay muuyq kach raah jôh iaq.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Bơh atoh adro leq heq dơơp hlu rơu, yôôych adro nưq heq dơơp hlu rơu leh vơ ka gô, đơu măn tol muuyq phon leq nưq — đnooy đanưq laa xôq gô leh rahloot gengq parêq tol dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Hmơt dook nưq deng ka adro đanưq bơyh phon karôp oh ay laa đu yôôch, <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />lunưq, wih hlê laa oh ay duh tha ka'lăk ji hlơq hlôôp ay nưq yôôych iaq, te be truh mưk leq nưq, adro đanưq hnoq ik biq nhonq karăp đom đơơt hlu rơu thier galơh ku ni. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Lunưq, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay dayh kahnoq vlôh xuum xung xiaq đôôyq dii adro nưq. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Dik, gô kung heq valơk vii kakơq neq: xôq gô hnoq ik xet jah bơơn xanưk dưk dơơp aduq oh ay, tabơh oh ay e tameng apok đom tôôy varơuq long be. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Panưh kadrơy, đôôyq dii adro đơu oh ay tha ka'lăk muuyq varơuq kajoq nưq, yôôych gô kung anưq — vii hloay kaah gô, đôôyq dii adro đơu gô heq tha ka'lăk (atoh gô heq tha ka'lăk muuyq varơuq kajoq nưq), nưq laa vii ich lơơy deng ka oh ay duq kangưưr Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />xôq ka haay klơlh biq Sa-tan aluut pa ôôh, vii be aalq haay leh xet kajoq truh kaluh varơuq xôq vih ku ni.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Bơh, atêq tuôôy hooy truh Trô-ach, ji ju muuyq poop 'mok ka Hêêl kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq jah luh vlôh ka gô đom Lôôk, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />bơh gô heq be e varơuq ahyơơl tơơp đom danưng kooy gô, vii gô heq leh tavơh ik Tit, adro oh ay ku gô. Lunư, atêq tuôôy aklah xing oot, gô dưk hooy truh Ma-xê-đoan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Anưq yôôch, kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy hloay hloay jarooy 'wot hooy jưq phon kach jah jay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ji gamưh 'wot, kahnoq vlôh muuy thơơm truh varơuq nhonq xet Kadraq măn tôôy aduq. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Vii đôôyq dii Kơy Plêêk, 'wot laa muuy thơơm ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh katul khơl adro jah wơơt ji katul khơl adro hư hlơơp — <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />ju đôôyq dii khơl adro neq, laa muuy vlôh xing varơuq kaxêêt xôq wih truh varơuq kaxêêt, bơh đôôyq dii khơl adro kadrơy, laa muuy thơơm vlôh xing varơuq riirh xôq wih truh varơuq riirh. Kơyq đu paraat ka kaluh varơuq neq? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Vii 'wot leh dang đaji 'ngưng adro tabôôt tek apok ku Kơy Plêêk vii lơơy, bơh đaji bơyh xuum dong dik paxa rêh, đaji laa xing Kơy Plêêk, 'wot padoh taboon kangưưr Kơy Plêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />E jơq 'wot laay xarôp vado kadih xăk? Long đaji muuyq sôôq adro, be aleq 'wot duh thư jơyq thiuq atăq truh oh ay long xing oh ay? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Kadih oh ay laa hla thư ku 'wot, heq jah valơk đom xuum 'wot, jah tôôy adro xet ji đok, <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />vii jah kahnoq vlôh ro raang đaneq oh ay laa hla thư ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, heq jah 'wot văch xiap, leh aalq jah valơk bơơn phôôm bơh bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh, be aalq tol kapah phơu, đơu laa tol kapah xuum bơơn hlek. <verse eid="2CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Panưh kadrơy, gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, 'wot e xuum tuôq kajưk đanưq đôôyq dii Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Leh aalq vii 'wot e đu paraat xing aduq kadih xăk xôq biit đaji laa muuyq varơuq leq nưq laa raak play xing kadih xăk. Tađôôy muut đnư, paraat ku 'wot vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />laa Kơy kung heq khienq 'wot e paraat dơơp manih hơu varơuq ku tavek đơơu, leh aalq bơơn chư valơk, bơh laa bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel; vii chư valơk păk kaxêêt, măn Kơy Phool hiel khienq ka riirh. <verse eid="2CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Panưh kadrơy, atoh varơuq dơơp ku varơuq kaxêêt — jah akleh aklek bơơn chư tol phơu — heq jah kahnoq vlôh đom tađnah tađnaak, truh nôôy koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên leh e paraat 'yo hyioh muut mamưưt Môi-se vii kơq tađnah tađnaak biq hlơơp ku mamưưt kơy, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />yôôych be aalq varơuq dơơp ku Kơy Phool hiel hnoq kahnoq vlôh đom tađnah tađnaak kang 'ngưng iaq xet taleq? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Vii atoh tađnah tađnaak măn deng ka varơuq dơơp ku varơuq xưh xadrah, yôôych varơuq dơơp ku varơuq hyioh jăk kang galơh galaay tađnah tađnaak 'ngưng iaq đnoyq! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Dik, vii varơuq heq hmưq jah tađnah tađnaak yôôych leh jah tađnah tađnaak đom varơuq neq, vii kơq varơuq tađnah tađnaak galơh yơơt iaq. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Vii atoh varơuq biq hlơơp heq truh dii tađnah tađnaak, yôôych varơuq hloay măn hnoq truh đom tađnah tađnaak kang 'ngưng phon iaq!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Jo nưq, tuôôy e xuum takôô gamưh đanưq, 'wot nămq xok ưu thêq dii xuum thier kôk dik, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />ji leh dang đaji Môi-se, kơy heq biit đơ muuyq tômq vaayh tok tol mamưưt kơy wih truh varơuq leh xôq koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên 'yo hyioh muut lôôch dik ku tađnah tađnaak biq hlơơp. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Lunư, xuum klaak oot heq biq găk golh, vii dong truh hngơy neng, kung muuyq tômq vaayh nưq hloay e măn tol varơuq đok tavek duut, vii leh jah wơh luh, nưq laa bơyh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ni đơơu biq hlơơp . <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Bơh anưq, dong truh hngơy neng, long tuôôy leq ganuun Môi-se jah đok, yôôych muuyq tômq vaayh klum tok xuum oot, <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />măn atoh tuôôy leq akơyq nưq wih wiit xuq Lôôk, yôôych tômq vaayh nưq jah xagook hooy. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Panưh kadrơy, Lôôk laa Kơy Phool Hiel, ji Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk măn 'leq, yôôych e rayơh rayơơy măn đnư. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Măn dêq hloay haay, dii mamưưt leh biit đơ, xaraar jaraak tađnah tađnaak ku Lôôk, yôôych đong jah tađôôy đơơu jêêk vlôh kung muuyq long lơuq xing tađnah tađnaak truh tađnah tađnaak, dang đaji xing Lôôk, laa Kơy Phool Hiel.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Vii kơq varơuq nưq, tuôôy jư varơuq dơơp neq tyauq đaji mưk nưq đơu 'wot heq jah angơuq, 'wot be galeh galal gưlh xuum. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Tađôôy muut đnư, 'wot heq ka'lăk kaluh thưq đangq kamưưl padu kinq, tuôôy be xa măn đom varơuq va ih va oop, kung leh đnooy bơyq apok Kơy Plêêk, bơh laa xing varơuq đnooy vlôh varơuq dik, kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk ka xuum klaak tôôy manih kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Bơh pheq đnooy atoh Hêêl Kaxay ku 'wot e biq kariik kađoq, yôôych nưq laa heq biq kariik kađoq đom katul khơl adro hư hlơơp, <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />đơu đom katul bing oot, vangưl đơơy neq heq dơơp apul ngook biit ku khơl adro lưp tuôq nưq, truh nôôy xaraar tađnah Hêêl Kaxay tađnah tađnaak ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, Kơy laa long lơuq ku Kơy Plêêk, be xaraar ahnhe tol oot. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Vii 'wot leh padoh taboon kadih xăk, bơh laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, 'ngưq laa Lôôk, măn kadih xăk 'wot đaji khơl xapok ku oh ay vii kơq Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Vii Kơy Plêêk, Kơy heq xanoh: “Xaraar tađnah hnoq xaraar ahnhe xing pi 'lăp kamơng jaluk,” laa Kơy heq xaraar ahnhe đom xuum 'wot wih truh varơuq 'mek tađnah varơuq hlolh xet truh tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk aduq kangưưr Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Bơh 'wot tađnưk kuah bauq neq đom kaluh apoop wo vari dik, xôq varơuq kôt karôq galơh hloay ku taay yaak nưq laa xing Kơy Plêêk, leh aalq xing 'wot; <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />laa khơl manih chiuq ahnek ahnen đom tôôy panưh, bơh leh biq kateep; biq xôôl dôôl, bơh leh gưlh xuum; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />biq rôp toop, bơh leh biq qwel ka'lăk; biq hmơt gưlh, bơh leh kaxêêt hlơơp; <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />hloay taway đom xăk xamơk 'wot varơuq kaxêêt ku Lôôk Jê-xu hooy loch aduq, xôq varơuq riirh ku Lôôk Jê-xu kung hnoq ik jah kahnoq vlôh đom xăk xamơk 'wot; <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />vii ju đong riirh, 'wot hloay biq nôôp ka varơuq kaxêêt vii kơq Lôôk Jê-xu, xôq varơuq riirh ku Lôôk Jê-xu kung jah kahnoq vlôh đom xăk xamơk xatyauq 'laarq varơuq kaxêêt ku 'wot. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Đanưq, varơuq kaxêêt dưk dơơp đom 'wot, măn varơuq riirh yôôych măn đom oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Bơh tuôôy e kung muuyq xuum klaak ku xuum tuôq tyauq apok heq valơk: “Gô tuôq, lunưq gô đnooy,” 'wot kung tuôq, lunưq 'wot kung đnooy, <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />vii xet đaneq Kơy heq khienq Lôôk Jê-xu riirh hlê kung hnoq khienq 'wot riirh hlê dii Lôôk Jê-xu, ji hnoq kahnoq 'wot kung dii oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Dik, tôôy varơuq nưq laa vii kơq oh ay, xôq vanong plêêk, atêq tuôôy athêêp tok hlê 'ngưng manih iaq, hnoq ik khienq varơuq kuh kway truh mưk raah jôh deng ka tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Anưq, 'wot be galeh galal gưlh xuum. Lunư, pheq đnooy atoh manih pi gôk ku 'wot đong biq karaq ravoch , nưq bơh manih pi 'lăp ku 'wot đong jah dơơp đơơu tôôy muuyq hngơy. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Vii pơơl hwơơl ahyơơl tơơp ma jơy ku 'wot đong xagook hlê ka 'wot muuyq tuôông tađnah tađnaak đơơy đơơy, leh kajoq galơh, leh kajoq taso ik, <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />tuôôy 'wot leh tabông 'yo kaluh varơuq hloq ik, bơh laa kaluh varơuq leh hloq ik. Vii kaluh varơuq hloq ik laa ma jơy, măn kaluh varơuq leh hloq ik laa đơơy đơơy.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Vii haay xet đaneq atoh apoop hnhư 'laarq vari ku haay, 'ngưq laa ku pơ đơ neq, biq pahyaak ka'lăk, yôôych haay e muuyq hnhư xơy panưk vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk, laa hnhư đơơy đơơy tol kaluh tal plêêk, leh jo ti koot manih dơơp vlôh. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Ji dik, haay tanguh alo đom apoop hnhư neq, đong tuôôy takôô jah kahliik athêêp muut aduq măn ku haay xing tol plêêk, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />ji axit vlôh atoh heq hlưp yôôch, yôôych haay hnoq leh biq hloq laa kaluk kala. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ji dik, laa khơl manih đong măn đom pơ đơ neq, haay tanguh alo vii chiuq pơơl hwơơl, vii kơq varơuq nưq đơu haay leh xung biq leh ka'lăk, bơh jah kahliik athêêp muut, xôq kaluh thưq xatyauq 'laarq varơuq kaxêêt hnoq ik biq luôôt hlơơp bơyh varơuq riirh. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Panưh kadrơy, Kơy heq ralauq haay ka jơq varơuq neq laa Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy heq kahniq ka haay varơuq dơơp xanưk ku Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Jo nưq, ju hloay hloay kôk dik yôôych 'miêh xet đaneq tuôôy măn hnhư đom xăk xamơk neq, haay đong kach xangưưy klơlh Lôôk — <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />vii haay tawaak hooy bơyh xuum tuôq, leh bơyh varơuq hloq ik. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Măn 'wot kưq kôk dik ji hlah xuum long kach xangưưy klơlh xăk xamơk neq ji măn hnhư dii Lôôk yôôych iaq. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Lunưq, 'wot dêq xuum dêq paraat xôq jah hlah xuum Lôôk, ju măn đom hnhư long kach xangưưy. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Vii varơuq dăt băt đôôyq dii dêq hloay haay laa pheq biq kahnoq vlôh adroyq ngôôy xưh xadrah ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, xôq ka tôôy adro hnoq ik nhonq hlê kaluh kajoq taxưngq dii kaluh varơuq đơu xăk heq dưk dơơp gamưh xăk xamơk, hnoq ik laa tolh long xơuq.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Jo nưq, vii xet varơuq đangq kuh yôq ku Lôôk, 'wot xok xuum manih oot. Măn 'wot jah Kơy Plêêk xet hlolh, đơu gô kung takôô gamưh jah xet hlolh đom xuum klaak ku oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Leh aalq 'wot laay đong kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk dii oh ay, bơh laa đong ăm oh ay muuyq kawah pa ưưt vii kơq 'wot, xôq oh ay hnoq ik e apok tơơl hlê deng ka khơl adro pa ưưt akhwoak aduq kaveeh pi gôk đơu leh aalq đom xuum. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Vii atoh 'wot e vlôh adruôy, nưq laa vii Kơy Plêêk; atoh 'wot e talăng jăk, nưq laa vii oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Bơyh xung xiaq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh rôp băt 'wot, atêq tuôôy 'yo hloq varơuq neq: nưq laa muuyq adro heq kaxêêt thay ka tôôy adro, lunưq, tôôy adro heq kaxêêt. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Kadraq heq kaxêêt thay ka tôôy adro, xôq khơl leq đong riirh be măn riirh vii kadih xăk đnoyq, bơh laa vii Kơy heq kaxêêt thay oot ji heq jah khienq riirh hlê. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Lunưq, xing juneq, 'wot leh măn xet kơyq tyauq xăk xamơk. Pheq đnooy ju 'wot heq hmưq nhonq xet Lôôk wơơt Dêh tyauq xăk xamơk, bơh juneq, 'wot leh măn nhonq xet Kadraq tyauq kach nưq đnoyq. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Vii anưq, atoh akơyq măn đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh yôôych laa muuyq koot manih đơơu. Kaluh varơuq duut heq dalơh hooy; 'yo hơq, kaluh varơuq đơơu heq truh. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Lunư, dêq hloay kaluh varơuq neq vlôh xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy heq dơơp tagu hlê haay dii kadih Kadraq gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji heq pahnăp ka 'wot varơuq dơơp tagu hlê neq, <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />đaji laa Kơy Plêêk măn đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, tuôôy tagu hlê dêh araak dii Kadraq, leh jauq kaluh kadrôôp maroh ku oot tachơơl hlê dii oot, ji heq xôq đom 'wot đaauq tagu hlê nưq.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Jo nưq, 'wot laa khơl jah patăk thay mot Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, đaji laa Kơy Plêêk đong tawooyh taayh gamưh 'wot: 'Wot apôôy vôôch thay mot Lôôk Wơơt Dêh: “Dayh jah tagu hlê dii Kơy Plêêk!” <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kadraq heq khienq Kơy heq be nhonq xet kadrôôp maroh jêêk vlôh kadrôôp maroh thay ka haay, xôq haay jah jêêk vlôh varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk đom Kơy nưq.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Panưh kadrơy, đong tuôôy kung dơơp varơuq dii Kadraq, 'wot kung apôôy vôôch oh ay te nhonq vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk kach đaji hloh — <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />vii Kadraq xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Đom tuôôy jah nhonq, gô heq đong tameng xôq tơơl hlê koot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ji đom hngơy wơơt xok, gô heq wơơt waak koot.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">“Hơq, juneq laa tuôôy hlah nhonq. Hơq, juneq laa hngơy wơơt xok.” —<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />bơơn kach leh dơơp kơq xatôôlh lôp đom paq kê varơuq kajoq, xôq varơuq dơơp ku 'wot klơlh biq đnooy toah, <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Tađôôy muut đnư, đom tôôy varơuq, 'wot kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk đaji khơl xapok ku Kơy Plêêk: đom varơuq chiuq uunq thier kôt, đom 'ngưng pơơl dal, đom 'ngưng pơơl hwơơl, đom đơơt parêq parơh, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />đom kaluh hlêêl panoon, đom aduq hnhư karuk, đom aduq paloanq, đom varơuq pơơl hwơơl, đom kaluh klôôy leh ik vik, đom kaluh đơơt pangoot hrah, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />đom varơuq paxa rêh, đom varơuq hlolh xet, đom varơuq atuq xuum, đom varơuq hwêêt xuum, đom Kơy Phool Hiel, đom xuum xung xiaq dong dik, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />đom apok varơuq dik, đom taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk; gamưh kaluh khêêl jaauq hyioh jăk aduq ti akoh ji ti akeng, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />xing tađnah tađnaak hloay nhuk dik, xing apok xơuq hloay apok kaxay; đaji adro aluut pa ôôh, đơu laay đangq tuôq gamưh; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />đaji be ik xet truh, đơu laay jah 'ngưng adro nhonq xet; đaji jeq kaxêêt, đơu — hơq! — măn riirh; đaji chiuq hmơt dook, đơu laay leh biq păk kaxêêt; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />đaji chiuq hlu rơu, bơh hloay hlah hlaak; đaji adrah pơơl, bơh dơơp ka 'ngưng adro jêêk vlôh karoh; đaji be e kajoq, đơu laay heq jah tôôy varơuq.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Oh ay manih Kô-rinh-tô lơơy, vel 'wot heq luh vlôh đôôyq dii oh ay; xuum 'wot heq jah luh ranưh. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Leh aalq oh ay biq bo vek bơyh 'wot, bơh oh ay biq bo vek bơyh xuum oh ay; <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />lunưq đom varơuq bla hlê dong xađong — gô đnooy đaji dang dii on oh — oh ay kung dayh xôq kadih xăk jah luh ranưh vlôh.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Te chiuq pơq varaq leh achung dii khơl adro be tuôq, vii varơuq hyioh jăk ji lưp ganuun e varơuq dơơp raa kajoq? Long xaraar tađnah dii kamơng jaluk e varơuq anguk achung leq? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Lôôk Wơơt Dêh dii Bê-li-an e varơuq tagu kajoq? Long manih tuôq e phon kajoq achung dii adro leh tuôq? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk kung dii vangưl e varơuq tagumq kajoq? Vii haay laa hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh, dang đaji Kơy Plêêk heq xanoh đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Gô hnoq măn ji hooy hlê hooy hooy đom katul oot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Gô hnoq laa Kơy Plêêk ku oot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">ji kadih oot hnoq laa tamooy Gô.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Lunưq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Dayh hooy vlôh xing katul bing oot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">ji chiuq aklah vlôh dii oot,” Lôôk xanoh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“ji te đungq truh tuôông klơơr 'yêq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">yôôch Gô hnoq đoonq nhonq êêp koot.”<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ji</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">“‘Gô hnoq laa Vaq đôôyq dii êêp koot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">ji êêp koot hnoq laa koot kanau, koot kadrê đôôyq dii Gô,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Lôôk Taay Yaak xanoh.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Jo nưq, wơơy oh ay xung xiaq, vii e kaluh apok tavek nưq, haay dayh paxa rêh kadih xăk klơlh tôôy 'moh nhơy ku xăk xamơk ji danưng kooy, tuôôy dơơp varơuq paxa rêh jêêk xaleep đom varơuq kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Dayh deng aduq ka 'wot! 'Wot heq be dơơp ra ơơh muuyq akơyq; 'wot heq be dơơp pa hư muuyq akơyq; 'wot heq be aluut muuyq akơyq. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Gô leh đnooy xôq wih truh varơuq xưh xadrah oh ay; vii gô heq hmưq đnooy adroyq đaneq oh ay măn đom xuum 'wot, xôq kung mamuuyq kaxêêt ji kung mamuuyq riirh. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Varơuq tuôq gamưh ku gô aduq oh ay yôôych 'ngưng; xuum pa ưưt ku gô truh oh ay yôôych kôt. Gô heq jah galơh galaay varơuq ahmưk nhăk. Gô jah thier 'ngưng xuum hlah neq đom tôôy pơơl hwơơl ku 'wot.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Vii hloay kaah atêq tuôôy gô hooy truh Ma-xê-đoan, xăk xamơk 'wot heq be e varơuq padơy axit leq, bơh biq pơơl hwơơl đom tôôy panưh — 'ngưng tahmơt tayaat pi gôk, 'ngưng kamo yôq pi'lăp. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Lunư, Kơy Plêêk, Kơy hlơq hlôôp khơl akơyq ruh rooy, heq hlơq hlôôp 'wot bơơn varơuq Tit truh đnen, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />đơu leh vơ xing varơuq truh đnen ku nhu nưq, bơh măn xing varơuq ahmưk nhăk đơu nhu nưq heq jah hlơq hlôôp măn aduq oh ay, tuôôy taboon ka 'wot truh xuum trôôch takôô ku oh ay, varơuq nhim alo ku oh ay, xuum talăng jăk ku oh ay vii kơq gô, ka pheq đnooy gô kang jah hlah hlaak iaq đnoyq.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Vii pheq đnooy atoh gô dơơp ka oh ay hlu đom thư, yôôych gô leh biit alay 'leq. Pheq đnooy atoh gô 'miêh biit alay (gô hloq đaneq hla thư nưq heq dơơp oh ay hlu, ju vơ đom muuyq jơy), <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />yôôych juneq, gô hlah hlaak, leh aalq vii oh ay heq biq hlu rơu, bơh vii oh ay heq biq hlu rơu xôq wih truh varơuq wiit xuum. Vii oh ay heq biq hlu rơu tyauq Kơy Plêêk, xôq ka oh ay hnoq ik be chiuq ra ơơh đom paq kê varơuq kajoq xing aduq 'wot. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Bơyh varơuq hlu rơu tyauq Kơy Plêêk dơơp yuôôr varơuq wiit xuum xôq wih truh varơuq wơơt xok đơu leh huq alay. Bơh varơuq hlu rơu ku dêh araak yôôych xagook truh varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Vii 'yo hơq, kung varơuq dơơp nưq, tuôôy jah dơơp ka hlu rơu tyauq Kơy Plêêk, yôôych heq xagook hlê đom oh ay xuum talăng jăk xet taleq: măn e varơuq đnooy bing đaleq, varơuq tôq tơh đaleq, varơuq kuh yôq đaleq, xuum trôôch takôô đaleq, xuum tôq dayh đaleq, varơuq ta'meq dook đaleq! Đom tôôy varơuq, oh ay heq kahnoq vlôh xăk laa xarêh xaraat truh đom varơuq neq. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Lunưq, pheq đnooy ju gô heq valơk ka oh ay, yôôych leh aalq vii kơq manih heq dơơp varơuq lưp troq, long vii kơq manih heq biq dơơp ra ơơh, bơh laa vii kơq xuum talăng jăk ku oh ay, 'ngưq laa varơuq thay mot 'wot, heq jah kahnoq vlôh ka oh ay kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Gamưh varơuq neq, 'wot heq jah ahmưk nhăk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Panưh kadrơy, đôôyq dii varơuq ahmưk nhăk ku kadih xăk, 'wot heq kang jah mưng me 'ngưng iaq aduq hlah hlaak ku Tit, vii danưng kooy ku nhu nưq heq jah dơơp ka ahyơơl tơơp bơyh dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Vii atoh gô hmưq pa ưưt varơuq kajoq dii nhu nưq truh oh ay, yôôych gô heq be huq kamưưl, bơh đaji tôôy varơuq 'wot heq đnooy dii oh ay đom varơuq dong dik, yôôych apok pa ưưt vlôh ku 'wot kung heq jah kahnoq vlôh varơuq dong dik đanưq đôôyq dii Tit. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ji xuum xung xiaq ku nhu nưq deng ka oh ay yôôych raah jôh iaq đnoyq, tuôôy văch hlê varơuq tameng apok ku dêq hloay oh ay, đaleq đơu oh ay heq đoonq tiip nhu nưq dii varơuq kamo yôq ji padrau padrik. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Gô hlah hlaak vii gô tuôq gamưh aduq oh ay đom tôôy varơuq.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Wơơy oh ay, 'wot kahnoq ka oh ay xet truh vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk heq jah kahniq ka đom katul kaluh tayuup vah thuôk Ma-xê-đoan, <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />nưq laa đom đơơt thưh thek parêq parơh ku varơuq rôp toop, xuum hlah raah jôh ku oot ji varơuq adrah thier pơơl ku oot heq aluulh galaay jêêk varơuq karoh e ku xuum ranưh ranơơy oot. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Vii gô dơơp xanưk đaneq oot heq tưp xatyauq paraat, pheq đnooy galơh iaq paraat gô, bơyh xuum trôôch kadih, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />kung dii 'ngưng apok xadrook apôôy, tuôôy eep dăt 'wot dong jah vanong ji varơuq jưq phon đom varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq neq deng ka khơl vah. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Ji be kaluh tyauq kach 'wot heq takôô, bơh adroyq dêq oot heq tơơk tưp kadih xăk ka Lôôk, yôôch ka 'wot, gamưh muut iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Tyauq anưq, 'wot ahmưk dăt Tit, xôq nhu nưq heq xarôp varơuq đaleq, yôôych dang anưq, nhu nưq kung hnoq ik payôôch varơuq dơơp vanong kaxay nưq ka oh ay đanưq. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Lunư, đaji oh ay galơh iaq đom tôôy varơuq, truh xuum tuôq, apok đnooy, varơuq hlolh xet, xuum talăng jăk dêq xăk, ji xuum xung xiaq xing aduq 'wot măn đom oh ay, xôq ka oh ay kung duh galơh iaq đom varơuq dơơp vanong kaxay neq. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Be aalq gô đnooy tyauq dang apok tanưưl, bơh laa gamưh xuum talăng jăk ku khơl manih kadrơy, 'yo xanưk varơuq dong dik truh xuum xung xiaq ku oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Vii oh ay nhonq xet vanong plêêk ku Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, nưq laa vii kơq oh ay, ju laa karoh e, Kadraq heq jêêk vlôh adrah, xôq ka gamưh varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku Kơy nưq, oh ay jêêk vlôh karoh e.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ji gô ăm vlôh apok đnooy truh dong varơuq neq, vii varơuq neq xagook hlê ich lơơy ka oh ay, laa khơl manih leh vơ heq xarôp dơơp varơuq neq xing muuyq xanưm adroyq, đơu măn xuum trôôch dưk dơơp đnoyq. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Măn juneq, oh ay kung dayh payôôch varơuq heq dưk dơơp, aleq ka varơuq 'miêh xuum dưk dơơp xuum trôôch đaleq, yôôych varơuq payôôch xing aduq paraat đong e kung đanưq. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Vii atoh varơuq 'miêh xuum e adroyq yôôch, yôôych kua tơơk tưp jah hlah nhonq xatyauq varơuq đơu 'miêh laa xăk e, be aalq tyauq varơuq đơu xăk leh e.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Dik, leh aalq xôq varơuq ahyơơl tơơp yôôych deng ka khơl kadrơy, măn varơuq parêq parơh yôôych deng ka oh ay, bơh laa tyauq kach ma tooq. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Muut kawat juneq, varơuq raah jôh ku oh ay deng ka varơuq thiuq lơyq ku khơl manih nưq, xôq varơuq raah jôh ku khơl manih nưq kung hnoq ik laa deng ka varơuq duh ku oh ay, aleq ka e varơuq ma tooq, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />dang đaji heq valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">“Manih e 'ngưng leh rah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">adro e axit kung be thiuq.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Bơh kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, Kơy xôq kung muuyq varơuq talăng jăk truh oh ay muut xuum Tit. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Bơyh nhu nưq ju laa heq chiuq nhonq apok ahmưk panhăk ku 'wot, bơh vii e xuum thier talăng jăk, nhu nưq heq kadih truh dii oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Panưh kadrơy, 'wot heq patăk muuyq adro oh ay kung hooy achung dii nhu nưq, đơu apok vado ku adro neq đom Hêêl Kaxay pahêêr loch dêq hloay kaluh tayuup vah; <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />đơu leh vơ anưq, bơh kung vii heq jah bơu rơơlh bơyh kaluh tayuup vah đaji 'wơyq kung hooy ku 'wot, kung dii varơuq dơơp vanong kaxay neq, laa varơuq đong jah 'wot dưk nhonq wih truh tađnah tađnaak ku Lôôk, ji kahnoq vlôh varơuq 'miêh xuum ku 'wot; <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />tuôôy jư chưng mưk đanưq, be e akơyq hnoq ik toah 'wot truh kawah raah ranưh đong jah 'wot dưk nhonq neq. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Vii 'wot biit 'yo adroyq truh kaluh varơuq kaxay tamaq, leh vơ kangưưr Lôôk, đơu măn kangưưr manih kadrơy.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Đêh vlôh, 'wot heq patăk muuyq adro oh ay ku 'wot kung hooy dii oot, nưq laa adro đơu 'wot heq thư xanưk đom 'ngưng panưh, vii ragơy e xuum talăng jăk, đơu juneq kang talăng jăk iaq gamưh xuum tuôq kajưk kôt aduq oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Atoh laa truh Tit, nhu nưq laa adro waak varơuq ku gô ji 'wơyq kung dơơp varơuq đôôyq dii oh ay. Atoh laa taleq oh ay hơq ku 'wot, oot laa khơl jah patăk ku kaluh tayuup vah, laa tađnah tađnaak Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Jo nưq, tuôôy kahnoq vlôh dii oot bơơn xanưk xuum xung xiaq ku oh ay ji apok pa ưưt ku 'wot truh oh ay laa kahnoq vlôh adroyq kangưưr kaluh tayuup vah.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Truh varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq deng ka khơl vah, yôôych neq laa varơuq raah jôh xôq gô pheq valơk ka oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Vii gô xet varơuq 'miêh xuum ku oh ay, laa varơuq đơu gô thay mot oh ay pa ưưt dii khơl tuôq Ma-xê-đoan, đaneq tayuup vah aduq A-chai heq ralauq xing muuyq xanưm adroyq, ji xuum talăng jăk ku oh ay heq anhơơu talơ 'ngưng adro iaq. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Bơh gô heq patăk dăt taleq oh ay hơq, xôq apok pa ưưt ku 'wot truh oh ay be biq xalôônq xalaaoq đom dong varơuq neq, xôq ka oh ay hnoq ik ralauq đaji gô heq đnooy. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Bơơn leh, atoh taleq adro tuôq Ma-xê-đoan hnoq ik hooy kung gô ji hloq varơuq leh ralauq aduq oh ay, yôôych 'wot biq kamưưl — nưq laa koq đnooy truh oh ay — vii varơuq tuôq kajưk nưq ku 'wot. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Lunưq gô heq biit ahluk hluul khơl oh ay nưq laa varơuq duh dik, xôq ka oot hnoq ik truh adroyq dii oh ay ji ralauq 'miêh kaluh kadrool heq tavek neq ku oh ay, xôq e varơuq palauq ralauq tyauq kach nưq đaji muuyq vanong, đơu leh đaji varơuq băt eep.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Panưh kadrơy, gô đnooy varơuq neq: akơyq paraay kach axit yôôych hnoq goch kach axit, ji akơyq paraay aduq kaluh vanong kaxay yôôych hnoq goch aduq kaluh vanong kaxay. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Tôôy adro tơơk tưp tyauq đaji xăk heq đinq adroyq đom xuum, leh vlôh xing varơuq hlu rơu long xing varơuq raanq eep, vii Kơy Plêêk xiaq adro hlah xuum tơơk tưp. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Măn Kơy Plêêk e qwuyen khienq tôôy vanong kaxay raah jôh tol oh ay, xôq hloay hloay đom tôôy varơuq, vii e đu dêq varơuq duh jung, oh ay hnoq ik raah jôh đom tôôy varơuq kaxay. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Đaji e valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Akơyq ahlook aklah kua ăm hloh, akơyq palo ăm ka khơl adrah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">yôôych varơuq hyioh jăk ni măn hlê dong truh đơơy đơơy.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Panưh kadrơy, Kơy ahlook kalook adrek ka adro paraay ji tôôp xôq dơơp tuôông xa hnoq atăq ăm kach thier 'ngưng, hnoq dơơp kalook adrek ku oh ay athêêp 'ngưng, ji hnoq khienq kaluh raak play ku varơuq hyioh jăk aduq oh ay athêêp tok, <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />tuôôy jah raah jôh đom tôôy panưh xôq dêq xuum ranưh ranơơy, laa varơuq xagook truh apok kuh kway Kơy Plêêk gamưh haay, <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />vii varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq neq leh vơ laa atăq ăm đu tol kaluh varơuq duh ku khơl vah, đơu măn dơơp ka viik galaay bơơn 'ngưng apok kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />tuôôy ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk gamưh bơơn xanưk ku varơuq dơơp neq gamưh tol varơuq tameng tyauq aduq apok xưng vlôh ku oh ay đôôyq dii Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji gamưh tol xuum ranưh ranơơy đom varơuq tagumq hlê deng ka oot ji ka tôôy manih, <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />hloay đom apok apôôy ku oot truh oh ay, thier trôôch takôô oh ay vii vanong plêêk thier kôt ku Kơy Plêêk tol oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Varơuq kuh kway tưp tok Kơy Plêêk vii kadrool leh aleq atoh ik ku kadraq!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Kadih xăk gô, Phao-lô — laa manih ju pơh pơơl tuôôy tavơh mot đom katul oh ay, bơh laay kôk kalh dii oh ay tuôôy wăngq mot — ahmưk nhăk oh ay bơơn varơuq xuum hwêêt ji hien lơyq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Gô apôôy vôôch đaneq, tuôôy e mot, yôôych gô hnoq be duh kôk kalh dii varơuq tuôq kajưk đơu gô đong biit laa pheq dơơp kalh ti tachơơl dii taleq adro ăm đaneq 'wot đaji dang đong tawaak hooy tyauq xăk xamơk. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Vii ju riirh đom xăk xamơk, bơh 'wot be hmơt jăk tyauq xăk xamơk. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Vii kaluh khêêl jaauq hmơt jăk ku 'wot leh aalq laa xăk xamơk, đơu laa taay yaak đom Kơy Plêêk deng ka varơuq pahyaak ka'lăk kaluh đôôn hôôm, hmơt hrưp kaluh apok tagêh <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />kung tôôy varơuq katơơk galơh dưk tok tachơơl hlê varơuq hlolh xet truh Kơy Plêêk, ji rôp jư tôôy iq biit rawiit xuq varơuq tameng tyauq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh; <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />ji e xuum talăng jăk xôq khienq tôôy varơuq dơơp lưp tameng pheq bla jaq, tuôôy varơuq tameng tyauq ku oh ay heq jah xaleep.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Oh ay đong 'yo varơuq măn tol pi mot. Atoh akơyq tuôq kajưk aduq xăk xamơk đaneq xăk thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, yôôych adro nưq dayh biit 'yo hlê varơuq neq truh kadih xăk, đaneq: adro nưq thuôk Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đaleq yôôych 'wot kung đanưq. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Vii pheq đnooy atoh gô e pa ưưt varơuq kajoq athêêp 'ngưng truh qwuyen da uh ku gô, laa qwuyen da uh Lôôk heq kahniq deng ka varơuq rôôk đơ đơu leh aalq ka varơuq pahyaak hrưp oh ay, yôôych gô hnoq be huq kamưưl, <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />xôq gô be vlôh kaveeh đaji dang khienq oh ay pheq varaal yôq bơơn thư ku gô. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Vii e adro đnooy: “Ju taleq hla thư ku kơy nưq apok parêq ji kôk kalh, bơh tuôôy e mot bơơn khiêk bơơn hlek măn đnen yôôych pơh pơơl, ji apok đnooy be ra kajoq.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Adro đanưq dayh biit 'yo varơuq neq, tuôôy wăngq mot 'wot laa đaleq đom apok đnooy hlê kaluh hla thư, yôôych tuôôy e mot varơuq dơơp ku 'wot kung đanưq.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Vii 'wot leh hôôk xađong long taso 'wot dii muuyq vaarq adro galơh tok kadih xăk. Bơh khơl adro nưq — tuôôy wolh oot aduq kadih oot, ji taso kadih xăk dii kadih oot — yôôych be hlolh xet kajoq. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Wih hlê, 'wot hnoq leh pa ưưt truh kaluh kajoq qwaq mưk, bơh laa tyauq ka mưk đom kawah nưq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq aklah ahlook ka 'wot, muuyq ka mưk heq lơy truh aduq oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Vii 'wot be aalq đong kadih galơh qwaq mưk, đaji tuôôy koq hmưq tawaak truh oh ay, vii pheq đnooy, 'wot heq hooy adroyq truh aduq oh ay bơơn Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />be pa ưưt truh kaluh kajoq qwaq mưk aduq kaluh kông pơơl ku khơl kadrơy, bơh vii e xuum takôô gamưh aduq oh ay, tuôôy xuum tuôq ku oh ay jah athêêp tok, xôq kaluh kông pơơl tyauq aduq nưq ku 'wot jah dong kôt truh mưk raah jôh, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />xôq padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay aduq kaluh dêh kach xangưưy oh ay — klơlh pheq pa ưưt truh kaluh kajoq heq jah ralauq 'miêh đom aduq nưq ku khơl kadrơy.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />“Bơh akơyq pa ưưt xăk, dayh pa ưưt xăk đom Lôôk.”<verse eid="2CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Vii be aalq adro kadih ayuôôt laat kadih xăk yôôych adro nưq e varơuq kông nhonq, bơh laa adro đơu Lôôk ayuôôt laat.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Trôôch kajoq oh ay 'miêh heq chiuq uunq muuyq axit parưngq rapơ ku gô, lunư oh ay juneq đong chiuq uunq gô! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Vii gô 'yarơ jaraq truh oh ay, dii xuum 'yarơ ku Kơy Plêêk, vii gô heq ga oh ay ka muuyq kanau, kahnoq oh ay đaji muuyq tadăp kadrê măn blaay ka Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Bơh gô biit yôq, te be tyauq kach leq nưq, đaji volh heq aluut pa ôôh Ê-va bơơn varơuq xơk tauq ku ni, yôôych xuum biit oh ay hnoq ik biq tawol toor kach xangưưy xuum dong dik ji pa xarêh deng ka Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Bơyh atoh akơyq nưq truh đnooy vlôh muuyq Jê-xu đêh đơu 'wot heq be padoh taboon, long oh ay nhonq muuyq yaak kadrơy, leh aalq Kơy oh ay heq nhonq, long muuyq Hêêl Kaxay kadrơy đơu oh ay heq be nhonq xok, yôôych oh ay hlơu klêq chiuq uunq!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Măn gô 'yo hloq gô be e kajoq thuua iaq khơl “jah rơơlh kôt galơh” hơq. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Bơh pheq đnooy ju laa koq hok đom varơuq đnooy padoh, bơh be aalq laa koq hok truh hlolh xet, đơu đom tưng dong varơuq heq kahnoq ro ka oh ay đom tôôy kach. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Long aalq be gô lôp kadrôôp, tuôôy haaq xăk pôôt xôq oh ay hnoq ik jah vanê tok, vii kơq gô heq padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk kach hlo hloh ka oh ay? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Gô heq vook xok kaluh tayuup vah kadrơy, tuôôy heq nhonq atăq ăm ku oot xôq deng ka varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Tuôôy măn dii oh ay — ju chiuq thiuq lơyq — gô heq leh dơơp gengq parêq ka paq kê akơyq. Vii atêq tuôôy truh đnen, khơl oh ay xing Ma-xê-đoan heq atăq ăm dêq varơuq duh ku gô, ji đom tôôy varơuq, gô heq jư ji hnoq kưq jư kadih xăk leh aalq laa gengq parêq ka oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Varơuq dik ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn đom gô, lunưq xuum pa ưưt neq truh kadih xăk hnoq leh biq klơl hlê aduq kaluh dêh ku A-chai. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Vii varơuq kajoq? Vii gô leh xung xiaq oh ay ih? Kơy Plêêk xet gô e.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Măn varơuq gô đong dơơp, yôôych gô kung hnoq dơơp đnoyq, xôq gô hnoq ik varoh xok hlơu klêq ku khơl adro đong trôôch kawah aleq ka đom varơuq đơu oot đong pa ưưt, oot kung hnoq ik jah 'yo hloq dang đaji 'wot. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Vii taleq dro đanưq laa khơl jah rơơlh pa ôôh, bing dơơp kông aluut pa ôôh, tuôôy dơơp bôô jêêk khơl jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />E akêh kajoq 'leq, vii kadih xăk Sa-tan dơơp bôô jêêk yaak plêêk xaraar tađnah. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Lunưq be e kajoq kôt lơyq atoh khơl xapok ku ni kung dơơp bôô đaji khơl xapok hyioh jăk, đơu payôôch ku bing nưq yôôych hnoq taxưngq dii kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Gô đnooy hlê: Te akơyq biit gô laa vlô khưrq. Măn atoh leh, yôôych axit vlôh dayh đoonq nhonq gô đaji adro vlô khưrq, xôq gô kung hnoq ik pa ưưt akhwoak muuyq axit. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Varơuq đơu gô xung đnooy, yôôych be aalq gô đnooy tyauq Lôôk, bơh đaji laa đom varơuq vlô apoop aduq varơuq tuôq kajưk pa ưưt akhwoak neq. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Vii kơq 'ngưng adro pa ưưt akhwoak tyauq xăk xamơk, lunưq gô kung hnoq pa ưưt. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Vii ju laa khơl adro khôôt xet, bơh oh ay đong thier hlah hlaak chiuq uunq taleq adro vlô khưrq hơ hơq. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Vii atoh adro leq rôp oh ay dơơp xapok, atoh adro leq kek luôôt, atoh adro leq varoh xok, atoh adro leq kadih vanê xăk tok, atoh adro leq hmơt muut mamưưt oh ay, yôôych oh ay măn chiuq uunq. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Gô đnooy tyauq kach kamưưl, dang đaji laa kadih 'wot heq ravoch! Bơh atoh laa akơyq hnoq ik kôk kalh đom kaluh panưh leq — gô đong đnooy đom varơuq vlô apoop — yôôych gô kung kôk kalh đanưq. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Oot laa manih Hê-bơ-rơ? Gô kung anưq. Oot laa manih I-sơ-ra-ên? Gô kung anưq. Oot laa koot xau Ap-ra-ham? Gô kung anưq. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Oot laa xapok ku Lôôk wơơt Dêh? (Gô đnooy đaji dang biq adruôy) Gô măn iaq anưq đnoyq: galơh iaq đom varơuq pơơl hwơơl, galơh iaq đom tu karuk, đom tiel dook leh jauq nôôy, ragơy măn jeq gah varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Dăp yưk bơyh manih Jo Thaiq, gô heq chiuq poot kưl rooy, bơơt muuyq. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Pe yưk gô biq tiel bơơn gay. Muuyq yưk gô biq tiip phơu. Pe yưk gô biq karăp tau. Gô hmưq tavơh muuyq hngơy muuyq klôôy aduq tahli jaruq; <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />ragơy ragơy tol kaluh tuôôy hooy trôôk, tavơh 'ngưng ngwi hiêmh tol daak tavook, ngwi hiêmh dii khơl atôk, ngwi hiêmh vlôh xing tamooy gô, ngwi hiêmh vlôh xing kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, ngwi hiêmh đom theng kôt, ngwi hiêmh aduq wăngq we, ngwi hiêmh tol daak tahli, ngwi hiêmh bơyh khơl oh ay pa ôôh lar; <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />tavơh pơơl hwơơl ji kưk lơyq, 'ngưng tuôôy đom varơuq lưp ik vik, pangoot ji thaal, ragơy đom varơuq nhiinq xa, jaleek gauq ji lalôk; <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />athêêp muut đnư, đêh vlôh kaluh varơuq nưq, varơuq chơt athêêp tol gô tôôy hngơy laa varơuq lo biit truh dêq hloay kaluh tayuup vah. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Akơyq ravoch đơu gô leh ravoch? Akơyq biq xatôôlh lôp đơu gô leh biq huur vuh?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Atoh băt pheq pa ưưt, yôôych gô hnoq pa ưưt vlôh kaluh varơuq ravoch ku gô. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Kơy Plêêk, Vaq ku Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy đangq jah ayuôôt laat dong truh đơơy đơơy, xet đaneq gô leh đnooy pa ôôh! <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Aduq Đa-mach, kơy padrok dêh 'laarq qwuyen vuua A-rê-ta heq jư 'yo theng Đa-mach xôq rôp jư gô. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Yôôch gamưh muuyq 'mok kaxôô, gô heq jah raduk pôôt bơơn vuk xatyauq apưt theng, ji gô heq xaloot klơlh ti kơy nưq.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Nưq laa băt pheq khwoe xăk, ju be xagook ich lơơy kajoq, bơh gô hnoq đnooy đnoyq hlê kaluh varơuq ăm xet adroyq ji kaluh varơuq kahnoq vlôh ku Lôôk. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Gô xet muuyq adro đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kưl poot xanưm adroyq — e măn đom xăk xamơk long be, gô be xet, long laa măn pi gôk xăk xamơk, gô be xet, Kơy plêêk xet — muuyq adro đanưq heq jah xagook tok dong truh tal plêêk thưq pe. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Gô heq xet muuyq dro đanưq — ju đom xăk xamơk long pi gôk xăk xamơk, gô be xet, Kơy Plêêk xet — <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />đaneq adro nưq heq jah xagook truh Ba-ra-đi ji heq tameng kaluh apok leh ik đnooy đơu be ăm pheep muuyq adro leq đnooy vlôh. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Truh muuyq adro đanưq, gô hnoq pa ưưt. Bơh truh kadih xăk, gô hnoq leh pa ưưt, đêh vlôh măn đom kaluh ravoch ku gô. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Vii atoh gô xung trôôch pa ưưt vlôh, yôôych gô hnoq be aalq laa vlô khưrq, vii gô hnoq đnooy dong dik; bơh gô jư hlê, te be muuyq akơyq nưq hnoq ik biit truh gô galơh iaq varơuq adro nưq hloq ik aduq gô long tameng xing gô. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Vii kơq varơuq kôt galơh ku kaluh kahnoq vlôh, lunưq xôq gô be jêêk vlôh katơơk galơh, yôôych muuyq jaliê 'mooch đom xăk xamơk — muuyq kamuuych xơuq ku Sa-tan — heq jah kahniq ka gô xôq ni hnoq ik tiel dook gô, xôq ka gô leh jêêk vlôh katơơk galơh. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Truh varơuq neq, gô heq apôôy vôôch Lôôk pe yưk xôq Kadraq hruut ka'lăk ni klơlh gô. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Nưq đơu Kadraq heq xanoh dii gô: “Vanong plêêk ku Gô laa đu ka koot, vii taay yaak ku Gô jah kahnoq vlôh xaleep đom varơuq ravoch.” Vii anưq, gô hnoq thier raa hlah hlaak pa ưưt vlôh iaq đnoyq đom varơuq ravoch ku gô, xôq ka taay yaak ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn tol gô. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Jo nưq, gô hlah xuum đom kaluh ravoch, dơơp ra ơơh, pơơl dal, rôp toop, pơơl hwơơl vii kơq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh; vii tuôôy leq gô ravoch, yôôych tuôôy nưq gô jah kalh paraat.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Gô heq jêêk vlôh vlô khưrq; kadih oh ay heq eep băt gô đanưq. Vii gô 'miêh pheq jah oh ay ayuôôt laat, vii gô heq be thiuq muuyq varơuq kajoq ku “khơl jah rơơlh thier kôt” hơq, ju gô pheq đnooy be laa kajoq dêq. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Kaluh dơuq hlêêl ku muuyq adro jah rơơlh heq jah kahnoq vlôh đom katul oh ay dii dêq hloay varơuq atuq xuum — kaah dơuq hlêêl ji pheep akêh, kung kaluh varơuq taay yaak. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Vii 'leq laa varơuq đơu oh ay heq biq thuua iaq kaluh tayuup vah kadrơy, đêh vlôh varơuq kadih gô heq leh dơơp gengq parêq ka oh ay? Dayh ka'lăk dơyh ka gô varơuq lưp hyioh neq!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Dayh 'yo neq! Gô đong ralauq 'miêh truh dii oh ay yưk thưq pe neq, ji gô hnoq leh dơơp gengq parêq kajoq dêq. Vii gô be axek akhiim kaluh garuh anôôp ku oh ay, đơu laa kadih oh ay. Vii koot xau be aalq tagoop xôq ka miq vaq, bơh laa miq vaq deng ka koot xau. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Măn gô hnoq thier hlah hlaak tayuh haau, pheq đnooy chiuq tayuh xarêh dêq hloay vii kơq phool hiel oh ay. Jơq be tuôôy xung xiaq oh ay 'ngưng iaq, yôôych gô jah xung xiaq axit bơơt? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Bơh dayh kưq xôq anưq, kadih gô heq leh dơơp gengq parêq ka oh ay, lunư, vii laa adro khôôt xet, gô heq rôp xok oh ay bơơn aluut patuut. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Jơq be muuyq akơyq nưq, laa adro gô hmưq patăk truh oh ay, đơu gô heq gamưh adro nưq aluut oh ay? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Gô heq ahmưk dăt Tit ji patăk muuyq dro oh ay kadrơy kung hooy dii nhu nưq. Tabơh e aalq Tit heq aluut oh ay be? 'Wot heq be tawaak hooy dii kung muuyq danưng kooy ih? Leh achung kaluh hlêêl jôôk ih?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Adroyq neq, e aalq oh ay biit đaneq 'wot đong đnooy bing kadih dii oh ay? 'Wot laa đong đnooy kangưưr Kơy plêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. Bơh, oh ay xung xiaq lơơy, dêq hloay kaluh varơuq neq laa vii ich lơơy ka varơuq rôôk đơ oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Vii gô biit yôq, te be tyauq kach leq nưq, atêq tuôôy truh, gô be hnoq ik hloq oh ay đaji kaluh kajoq đơu gô biit trôôch, gô kung leh jah oh ay hloq đaji kiêuh đơu oh ay xung trôôch; te be e 'leq nưq varơuq takaay tayaat, 'yarơ, tôq jaraq, tagoa, đnooy pahnhiq, đnooy xơuq pi katoor, katơơk galơh, xalôônq xalaaoq, <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />te be atêq tuôôy gô truh yưk tra, Kơy Plêêk ku gô hnoq ik dơơp gô kamưưl mot truh oh ay, ji gô dik pheq alo nhim ka 'ngưng adro đom sôôq khơl adro tuôôy adroyq heq lôp kadrôôp ji heq be wiit xuum truh varơuq klơơr 'yêq, apuq atrăp ji bơyq ba đơu oot heq lôp.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Neq laa yưk thưq pe gô truh dii oh ay. “Tôôy dong varơuq hnoq jah dơơp kajưk gamưh tol apok ku vaarq long pe adro xanưk.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Gô heq đnooy adroyq đaji tuôôy truh yưk thưq vaarq, ji juneq, ju đong wăngq mot, gô kung đnooy — dii khơl adro tuôôy adroyq heq lôp kadrôôp, kung dêq hloay khơl adro măn hlê — đaneq atoh gô hnoq ik truh aduq neq yưk tra, gô hnoq leh tha ka'lăk 'leq, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />bơyh vii oh ay đong đooy vôôch bơơn xanưk Lôôk Wơơt Dêh xanoh pato aduq gô, laa Kơy leh ravoch đôôyq dii oh ay 'leq, bơh viik taay yaak đom katul oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Vii Kadraq heq xing aduq ravoch chiuq đongq đing tol gay charăk bơh Kadraq đong riirh bơyh taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk. Vii 'wot kung ravoch đom Kadraq, bơh đôôyq dii oh ay, 'wot hnoq riirh dii Kadraq bơyh taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Oh ay dayh 'yo hlê kadih xăk jơq be laa oh ay đong măn đom xuum tuôq. Dayh thư kadih xăk, Long oh ay leh nhonq xet kajưk dik truh kadih xăk đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu măn đom oh ay ih — atoh anưq, tabơh e aalq oh ay laa pa ôôh be? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Bơh gô takôô gamưh laa oh ay hnoq nhonq xet đaneq kadih 'wot be aalq laa pa ôôh. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Măn 'wot apôôy dii Kơy Plêêk xôq oh ay leh dơơp paq kê varơuq leh troq leq, be aalq xôq kadih 'wot hnoq ik kahnoq vlôh xăk laa đangq kông nhonq, bơh laa xôq kadih oh ay hnoq ik dơơp varơuq kaxay tamaq, ju kadih 'wot yôôych đaji dang leh jah kông nhonq. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Vii 'wot be hnoq ik dơơp muuyq varơuq kajoq tachơơl dii varơuq dik, wih hlê 'wot laa vii varơuq dik. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Vii 'wot hlah hlaak tuôôy 'wot yôôych ravoch măn oh ay jah kalh paraat. 'Wot kung apôôy ka varơuq neq: varơuq xaleep ku oh ay. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Vii kakơq nưq, đong tuôôy wăngq mot, gô valơk kaluh varơuq neq, xôq tuôôy e mot, gô leh huq xưh liq kach dơơp dik tyauq da uh qwuyen đơu Lôôk heq kahniq ka gô deng ka varơuq rôôk đơ, đơu leh aalq wih truh varơuq pahyaak hrưp.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Lôôch dik, wơơy oh ay, dayh hlah hlaak! Dayh wih truh varơuq xaleep, dayh xôq xăk jah hlơq hlôôp, dayh e kung ngook biit, dayh riirh tagu. Kơy Plêêk ku xuum xung xiaq ji varơuq hrok hrol hnoq măn kung oh ay.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Dayh vôôch hrok mamuuyq bơơn hiip vah. Dêq hloay khơl vah vôôch hlơq oh ay.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Apôôy vôôch vanong plêêk ku Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, kung xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk ji varơuq tagumq ku Lôôk Phool Hiel măn dii dêq hloay oh ay.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>